        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova denjili cheŋi kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, kamwili nlomboli yaTira, neyi, Mwanta Yehova nindi, Ochu chiwunananishi muchima weyi, chiwuneli neyi, Ami niNzambi, nashakama muchididi chaNzambi, mukachi katuluŋalwiji, kutoŋa eyi wumuntu, hiwuNzambuku, hela wadifuukula tuhu mumuchima, neyi, Nikweti maana neyi muchima waNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komana wukweti maana akubadika Danyeli, hikudi chuma chakujinda chanakuswekuwu eyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumaaneyi nikukashinshi keyi wunaheteluku maheta, wunaheteluku niwuru nisiliva yidi muwaswekaŋa yuma yeyi yalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumaaneyi abadika, nikukulandalanda kweyi wunavulishiluku maheteyi, wunananishi dehi nimuchima weyi namaheteyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Mwanta Yehova nindi, Ochu chiwunadifuukuli dehi mumuchima weyi neyi, NiNzambi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dichi tiya, ami nakakuletela antu akumatuŋa acheŋi, wowu antu amunyuza atiyawu woma, mpoku jawu jatubali akajihola kulonda akatapi lubanji lwamaaneyi, akatamishi nicheeya cheyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakukunkumwisha muwina. Wakafwa kufwa kwafwaŋa antu ajahaŋawu mukachi katuluŋalwiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatwesha kumwila owu wakakujaha neyi, Ami niNzambi? Ilaŋa muchikasa chanowu wukukutaŋa wumuntu kweyi, hiwuNzambuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakafwa maŋufwa afwaŋa ayidima, kumakasa awantu akumatuŋa acheŋi, muloŋa nahoshumu dehi. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova denjili cheŋi kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, mwimbili mwanta wakuTira mukeŋa, wumwili neyi, Mwanta Yehova nindi, Yeyi washika muchesekelu chikupu ndwa, yeyi wenzala maana, wukweti lubanji Lwawanina chikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeyi wadiŋi muEdeni mwitempa daNzambi. Wadiŋi wadileŋaleŋa malola ejima alema wuseya, sari dini, nintoŋaza, nidiyamondi, niberili, nishohama, ninja siperi, nisafira, niemeraladi, niilola dakejima, niwuru. Wukalawenu wandimba jeyi niwamahululu eyi wadiŋi mudeyi; ayiloŋesheli mwifuku dakuleŋeluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeyi wadiŋi kerubi awayishawu manji, mukwakujikahu. Nakushili mwaka wikalaŋa hampidi yaNzambi yajila. Mukachi kamalola akesi welilaŋa wuyamu, winzamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha kwifuku dakuleŋeluwu, wadiŋi waloŋa chikupu muyuma yejima welilaŋa, ndo nihawenuwu kuheŋa mudeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukulandalanda kweyi kwakuvulu enzesheli madombu mukachi keyi, wunavulumuni dehi. Dichi eyi watama dehi, nakunati dehi, nakufumishi dehi hampidi yaNzambi. Eyi kerubi mukwakujikahu, nakukisaŋani dehi, wubuli kwikala cheŋi mukachi kamalola akesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadinanishili mumuchima nansaŋu yalubanji lweyi, wunatokeshi dehi maaneyi nansaŋu yacheeya cheyi. Nakunati dehi heseki, nakwalaŋeshi kumesu awanyanta kulonda akumoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova denjili kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, talishaku mesu eyi kuZidoni, wuprofweti nsaŋu jakuyizuwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi, Mwanta Yehova nindi, Eyi Zidoni, tiya, ami nidi neyi nandombu, akanlemeshela mudeyi. Chinakakoŋa mudi yena munamusompesheleli, chinakadijilika mudi yena, akeluka nawu yami Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami nakatemesha mudi yena yipupu namashi munyikwakwa yindi. Akataŋawu akadimboka mukachi kindi nanoyi mpoku yakabali yakamujikilila niniku niniku. Akeluka nawu yami Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikwakekala nawa cheŋi chikwata chakulemekaŋa mutaŋa waIsarela, hela mwiŋa wakukatishaŋa ntu adi kudi wena kwi-ndo ayikoŋeli chatamaku. Akeluka nawu yami Mwanta Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nindi, Chinakela napompeshi dehi mutaŋa waIsarela, nayifumishi dehi munyuza yawantu mwaŋalaŋenawu, nadijiliki dehi mudi wena kumesu anyuza, akashakama mwituŋa dawu awenawu dinenkelikambuŋami Yakoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akashakamamu chakadi kwakama. Ena, akatuŋa matala, akadima matempa anyivinyu, akashakama chakadi kwakama, henohu nayikoŋi dehi antu ejima ayikoŋeli chatama kwi-ndo munayisompesheleli. Akeluka nawu yami Yehova Nzambi yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
